# Cloudflare security response headers, applied to every asset + the SPA shell.
# Vite copies public/ into dist/, and Cloudflare (Pages / Workers Static Assets)
# reads this file to attach the headers at the edge — no Worker code needed.
# NOTE: Content-Security-Policy is deliberately NOT set here yet — a strict CSP
# needs a report-only rollout first (it can break font/API/WS loads). Tracked as
# a separate hardening step.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
